{
  "id": "android_smarthome_231",
  "instruction": "Open the `Nursery air request` note in Markor on the phone and check Home for the equipment needed to complete it. If the required equipment is missing, report what is unavailable and why the calibration cannot be completed. Do not substitute another device or change Home.",
